# PostHog analytics.
# The project key is now baked into src/components/Analytics.astro as the default
# (it's a PUBLIC client-side key, safe to commit). You do NOT need to set anything
# here for production to work.
#
# These are OPTIONAL overrides — e.g. to point a staging build at a different
# PostHog project without editing code:
# PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=phc_your_override_key
# PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com

# --- SEO measurement (scripts/measure-*.mjs) — put real values in .env (gitignored) ---
# PostHog PERSONAL API key (phx_..., read scope) — this one IS a secret, never commit it:
# POSTHOG_PERSONAL_API_KEY=phx_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# POSTHOG_PROJECT_ID=493129
# POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.posthog.com
# Google Search Console service-account key (SA must be a user on the GSC property):
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/path/to/service-account.json
# GSC_SITE_URL=sc-domain:forest-international.com
